02)--RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(4), input_partitions=2, metrics=[output_rows=6]
03)----DataSourceExec: file_groups={2 groups: [[WORKSPACE_ROOT/datafusion/sqllogictest/test_files/scratch/parquet_struct_field_pruning/two_files/high.parquet], [WORKSPACE_ROOT/datafusion/sqllogictest/test_files/scratch/parquet_struct_field_pruning/two_files/low.parquet]]}, projection=[get_field(s@0, a) as __datafusion_extracted_1, s], file_type=parquet, predicate=get_field(s@0, a) < 10, metrics=[output_rows=6, files_ranges_pruned_statistics=2 total → 2 matched, row_groups_pruned_statistics=2 total → 2 matched, page_index_pages_pruned=0 total → 0 matched, limit_pruned_row_groups=0 total → 0 matched, scan_efficiency_ratio=26.69% (158/592)]

statement ok
